                "text": "Protecting the long-term health of our fisheries in the Great Lakes is critical to Michigan\u2019s economy and our way of life. I am glad to see the @NatResources Committee pass the Great Lakes Mass Marking Program Act, which I partnered with @RepDebDingell and @RepHuizenga to introduce. This critical bill will help us better understand how we can preserve the fisheries of the Great Lakes for future generations.",
